      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Pain researchers are committed to designing new experimental models as close as possible to the physiopathological conditions encountered in humans, with due concern for ethical considerations. Some current questions related to inflammation and headache are discussed, along with the approaches used to address them. These approaches are essential for a better understanding of the physiology, pharmacology, and treatment of various pain syndromes."},
